## What Was Built (Pass 1)

Three files added to the codebase. These are the entire Pass 1 implementation.

### `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/governanceEngine.ts`

Governance evaluation module. Not an annotation layer — it **changes behavior**.

**Behavior changes (not labels):**

| Trigger | What changes in the response |
|---|---|
| Privilege keywords in raw text | `clause_text`, `text`, `excerpt` fields replaced with `[REDACTED — privilege review required]`. Original text never returned. |
| CA non-compete in employment text | `escalation_required = true`, reason includes §16600 citation |
| Confidence < 0.5 | `escalation_required = true`, reason: `low_confidence` |
| All recommended actions generic | `escalation_required = true`, reason: `non_specific_output` |
| Specialist sets `escalation_required = true` | Governance honors it (passthrough) |

**Key functions:**
- `detectPrivilege(text)` — scans for attorney-client / work product keywords
- `detectCANonCompete(text)` — 8 regex patterns including "agrees not to compete", "shall not compete"
- `applyRedactions(output, fields, replacement)` — deep-copies output, replaces named fields
- `assignImpactTier(output, escalationRequired, policy)` — `action_triggering | decision_support | informational`
- `evaluateGovernance(input)` — main function; returns `GovernanceDecision` with `redacted_output` and `audit_event`

**`LEGAL_GOVERNANCE_POLICY`** (default policy):
```typescript
{
  confidence_threshold: 0.5,
  privilege_detection: true,
  escalation_rules: [
    { trigger: "privilege_keywords_in_text",    reason: "Privilege detected — counsel review required" },
    { trigger: "ca_noncompete_detected",         reason: "CA non-compete — void under CA Bus & Prof Code §16600" },
    { trigger: "confidence_below_threshold",     reason: "low_confidence" },
    { trigger: "incomplete_output",              reason: "incomplete_output" },
    { trigger: "non_specific_output",            reason: "non_specific_output" },
  ],
  redaction_rules: [
    { trigger: "privilege_keywords_in_text", field: "clause_text", replacement: "[REDACTED — privilege review required]" },
  ],
}
```

