### `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/legalPlaybook.ts`

10-scenario adversarial playbook with content quality assertions. Runs against `handleMatter` directly (not HTTP).

**Assertion logic (not just field presence):**
- `assertContentQuality()` — at least one specific recommended action (>50 chars, not matching generic patterns), all flags have `clause_text` or `rule` or `detected_text`, no unexpected empty arrays on full-work scenarios
- `isGenericAction(action)` — matches `/^(review|consult|seek|consider)\s+(with\s+)?(counsel|attorney|lawyer)/i` or length < 30
- `expects_empty_arrays` — `blocking_issues` is explicitly allowed to be empty (not a failure)

